%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 983baf44e5cdb194583b1c23ada50e41, type: 3}
  m_Name: Tutorials
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSO
  dialogueLines:
  - speakerName: BOSS
    dialogueText: Your job is to investigate cursed dolls. You'll run a series of
      tests with each doll. If a test yields abnormal results, mark it with a red
      check mark. If the doll shows no reaction, mark it with a green X.
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3db0c63128ac01641ba56c32c6a699ed, type: 3}
    answers:
    - answerText: I got it
      eventType: 3
  - speakerName: BOSS
    dialogueText: Audio Test. To do an audio test, place the doll in a secured room
      on a chair and play the audio through the computer.
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3fd829cf193636f4f805d8659ffcf6f4, type: 3}
    answers:
    - answerText: I got it
      eventType: 4
  - speakerName: BOSS
    dialogueText: Name Call. To call the doll's name, interact with the glass in
      front of the doll while it sits in the secured room.
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 853437238cccbc1498fb87e1d5b21188, type: 3}
    answers:
    - answerText: I got it
      eventType: 5
  - speakerName: BOSS
    dialogueText: Photograph Capture. To take a photo, place the doll on the chair
      in the back of the secured room and use the camera. Compare the developed photo
      with reality.
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 24a55f3acebabc54e950f91333d82dfa, type: 3}
    answers:
    - answerText: I got it
      eventType: 6
  - speakerName: BOSS
    dialogueText: "Temperature Test. To measure the doll's temperature, use the thermometer
      while looking at the doll. The room's temperature is between 16-25\xB0C. Any
      other value shown from the doll is an anomaly."
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7e519957716b5084ba54ab84c2d2206d, type: 3}
    answers:
    - answerText: I got it
      eventType: 7
  - speakerName: BOSS
    dialogueText: Physical Discomfort. To inflict pain, stab the doll with the scissors
      while it's in front of you.
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 00d3c68d81c15ec439ae80fcc82c7d2d, type: 3}
    answers:
    - answerText: I got it
      eventType: 8
  - speakerName: BOSS
    dialogueText: The computer provides help with items and tracks your progress.
      The 'Report' section shows tested dolls and any mistakes. Without an active
      assignment, you can retry any doll, or read its result, which is not required.
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ebb6b0a7d8d7ba44a8f3084ba34f4b5d, type: 3}
    answers:
    - answerText: I got it
      eventType: 9
  - speakerName: BOSS
    dialogueText: To start working with a new doll, ring the bell on the table. Study
      the document on the table before testing.
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f58e3a4171379be4e95a894292f76551, type: 3}
    answers:
    - answerText: I got it
      eventType: 10
  - speakerName: BOSS
    dialogueText: After completing all tests, place the doll in either the OK box
      or the Dangerous box. If it has shown any unusual behavior, even outside of
      testing, put it in the Dangerous box.
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 03100227bf9c1614181343f3d4bda97f, type: 3}
    answers:
    - answerText: I got it
      eventType: 11
